{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"啟德水上運動中心開幕禮　前消防局活化改建而成\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/SPORT-OPEN-261118-17.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】啟德水上運動中心舉行開幕禮。</p><p>康文署署長陳詠雯及立法會議員霍啟剛等為中心揭幕。中心位於跑道區，由前啟德消防局活化改建而成，保留紅白格外牆特色，佔地約4萬呎，提供龍舟、獨木舟、立划板、賽艇、帆船、竹筏及滑水等多項水上活動。</p><p>中心自今年4月起試業，累積超過3.5萬人次使用。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T10:44:10.264949+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T09:44:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T12:48:43.693953+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T10:37:30.373702+00:00","content_hash":"1df34e4906b1f2dc741638ec3e348eec4c9fd208a4eb7534281d45422e01a00f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}